<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-024" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin" source-id="s-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:head:m0000" ref="cvr_exv_dku">崔林</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:head:m0003" ref="cvr_exv_dku">德儒</persName>，清河東武城人也。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:recommendation" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">竊見司隷校尉<persName id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:recommendation:m0006" ref="cvr_exv_dku">崔林</persName>，稟自然之正性，體高雅之弘量。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:appointment" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">後年遂為司空，封安陽亭侯，邑六百戶。三公封列侯，自<persName id="c-sanguozhi-024-jin044-cuilin:appointment:m0025" ref="cvr_exv_dku">林</persName>始也。</p>
</text>
